  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Ink action with a brief pressure response; shared control defaults.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">保存</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:40px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:var(--radius);font:500 14px Inter,sans-serif;transition:background-color 160ms var(--ease-out),border-color 160ms var(--ease-out),transform 160ms var(--ease-out-strong);border:none;background:hsl(var(--primary));color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground));box-shadow:0 1px 2px hsl(var(--card-foreground)/.08)}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:hsl(var(--primary)/.9);box-shadow:0 2px 6px hsl(var(--card-foreground)/.12)}.ds-btn-primary:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(1px) scale(.985);transition-duration:80ms}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring));outline-offset:2px}.ds-btn-primary:disabled{opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}@media(pointer:coarse){.ds-btn-primary{min-height:44px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-btn-primary{transition:none}.ds-btn-primary:active{transform:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Outline Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-outline",
      "description": "White secondary action with a warm hover surface.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-outline\">取消</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-outline{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:40px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:var(--radius);font:500 14px Inter,sans-serif;transition:background-color 160ms var(--ease-out),border-color 160ms var(--ease-out),transform 160ms var(--ease-out-strong);border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));background:hsl(var(--card));color:hsl(var(--card-foreground));box-shadow:0 1px 2px hsl(var(--card-foreground)/.05)}.ds-btn-outline:hover{background:var(--field-warm);border-color:var(--line-strong)}.ds-btn-outline:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(1px) scale(.985);transition-duration:80ms}.ds-btn-outline:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring));outline-offset:2px}.ds-btn-outline:disabled{opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}@media(pointer:coarse){.ds-btn-outline{min-height:44px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-btn-outline{transition:none}.ds-btn-outline:active{transform:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "White field with a quiet border; touch inputs use 16px text.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span class=\"ds-label\">待办名称</span><input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"整理本周生活记录\"/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-family:Inter,sans-serif}.ds-label{font-size:12px;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.ds-input{height:40px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--input));border-radius:var(--radius);background:hsl(var(--card));color:hsl(var(--card-foreground));font:400 14px Inter,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 1px 2px hsl(var(--card-foreground)/.025);transition:border-color 160ms var(--ease-out),box-shadow 160ms var(--ease-out)}.ds-input:hover{border-color:hsl(var(--card-foreground)/.28)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring));outline-offset:2px}.ds-input[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:hsl(var(--destructive))}.ds-input:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}@media(pointer:coarse){.ds-input{min-height:44px;font-size:16px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-input{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Premium Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card-premium",
      "description": "White panel with an 8px corner and hairline border; flat at rest.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card\"><p class=\"ds-card-label\">本月支出</p><p class=\"ds-card-value\">¥1,280</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-card{background:hsl(var(--card));color:hsl(var(--card-foreground));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:16px;box-shadow:none;transition:border-color 200ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}.ds-card:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong)}.ds-card-label{margin:0;font:500 12px Inter,sans-serif;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.ds-card-value{margin:4px 0 0;font:600 28px \"JetBrains Mono\",monospace}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-card{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Category Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Semantic schedule category color.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\">日程</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:hsl(var(--cat-blue-bg));color:hsl(var(--cat-blue));font:500 12px Inter,sans-serif}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ghost Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Quiet auxiliary action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-ghost\">重置</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-ghost{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:40px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:var(--radius);font:500 14px Inter,sans-serif;transition:background-color 160ms var(--ease-out),border-color 160ms var(--ease-out),transform 160ms var(--ease-out-strong);border:none;background:transparent;color:hsl(var(--card-foreground))}.ds-btn-ghost:hover{background:hsl(var(--accent))}.ds-btn-ghost:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(1px) scale(.985);transition-duration:80ms}.ds-btn-ghost:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring));outline-offset:2px}.ds-btn-ghost:disabled{opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}@media(pointer:coarse){.ds-btn-ghost{min-height:44px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-btn-ghost{transition:none}.ds-btn-ghost:active{transform:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Warm selected surface with labels above it. Shared-layout movement runs in the application.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">首页</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#\">日程</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#\">待办</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:4px;font:500 14px Inter,sans-serif}.ds-nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;min-width:44px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:var(--radius);text-decoration:none;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));transition:color 160ms var(--ease-out),background-color 160ms var(--ease-out)}.ds-nav-item[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:hsl(var(--muted));color:hsl(var(--card-foreground))}.ds-nav-item:hover{color:hsl(var(--card-foreground))}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring));outline-offset:2px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-item{transition:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Warm Desk Ledger",
    "overview": "V-Life is a bilingual personal life OS that should feel like a well-kept desk blotter: warm cream paper, ink-dark text, hairline rules, and quiet category accents. Density favors scanability for Operate-mode tasks (todos, schedule, finance) over marketing flourish. Motion is short and purposeful (list enter-up, button press), and always yields to `prefers-reduced-motion`.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm cream canvas (`--background`) with white elevated cards",
      "Ink primary (`--foreground` / `--primary`) instead of saturated brand purple",
      "Category accents via `--cat-*` tokens; charts via `--chart-*`",
      "Fraunces for display headings; Inter for UI; JetBrains Mono for metrics",
      "Hairline borders (`--line`) + soft warm-brown shadows"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Ink Rule",
        "body": "Primary ink is for actions and hierarchy. Accents are for category meaning, not decoration.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat-By-Default Rule",
        "body": "Surfaces stay quiet at rest; shadow deepens on hover or modal elevation only.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use semantic tokens (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `text-cat-green`).",
      "**Do** respect `prefers-reduced-motion` (`.enter-up` off; no infinite distraction).",
      "**Do** keep bilingual copy via `t(zh, en)`."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** hard-code cream/ink hex in new UI (`#f4f3ee`, `#1f1a14`, `#8a847a`, `#e4e1d7`) — map to tokens.",
      "**Don't** invent a second category color map beside `--cat-*`.",
      "**Don't** ship icon-only controls without accessible names.",
      "**Don't** use purple-on-white marketing gradients; this product is warm ink on cream.",
      "**Don't** treat Inter/Fraunces as disposable without an explicit rebrand — they are the incumbent pairing until `/impeccable typeset` changes them."
    ]
  }
}
